  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "テラスタルポケモンが　倒れたとき砕けた　テラスタルジュエルがまれに　結晶化したもの。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "테라스탈 포켓몬이 쓰러졌을 때 부서진 테라스탈 주얼이 드물게 결정화한 조각.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "太晶寶可夢倒下時，碎裂的太晶寶石在罕見的情況下會結晶化，而形成此物。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un fragment cristallisé qui se forme rarement lors de l’éclatement d’un Joyau Téracristal après qu’un Pokémon Téracristal a été mis K.O.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In äußerst seltenen Fällen kristallisieren Bruchstücke des Terakristalls von im Kampf besiegten Terakristall- Pokémon zu solchen Tera-Stücken.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esquirla que se forma muy raramente cuando la joya Teracristal de un Pokémon teracristalizado se quiebra tras derrotarlo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cristallizzazione che raramente si forma quando un Pokémon Teracristal viene sconfitto e la sua gemma Teracristal va in frantumi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On rare occasions, these shards form when a Tera Pokémon falls in battle and its Tera Jewel shatters.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "テラスタルポケモンが　倒れたとき砕けた　テラスタルジュエルがまれに　結晶化したもの。",
      "version_group": {
